    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "",
      "uuid": "bf15b54df1844713bd3563dff5ca7ba5",
      "x": 9107.479708104667,
      "y": 3492.961445510764,
      "width": 300.0,
      "height": 200.0,
      "z_value": -9.706000000000163,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "AboutNode hides the standard EmojiButton (`_show_emoji_btn = False`) and builds its own shuffle mechanism. The emoji lives in `_shuffle_emoji` on the instance, not in `data.emoji`. Double-clicking the top strip reshuffles it."
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "AboutNode \u2014 Custom Shuffle",
      "uuid": "0374ffe0c57c46dda3cceb820d3cae6d",
      "x": 8800.160790207527,
      "y": 3237.198965540292,
      "width": 296.0,
      "height": 52.0,
      "z_value": -9.707000000000162,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "AboutNode \u2014 Custom Shuffle",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "",
      "uuid": "fc8ddf63f5894b61975f6c8109891150",
      "x": 8716.37466635956,
      "y": 3372.208553766406,
      "width": 300.0,
      "height": 200.0,
      "z_value": -9.708000000000162,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "- **Offline push attempt**: Sets emoji to `\ud83d\ude12` (unamused face) when the connectivity check fails. A passive-aggressive but accurate status indicator.\n- **Successful push**: Shuffles to a random emoji from the pool \u2014 celebration mode."
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "GitNode \u2014 Mood Indicator",
      "uuid": "95c74d223fd74620abd47e813dbcb13e",
      "x": 8611.242392234362,
      "y": 3058.082023171586,
      "width": 277.0,
      "height": 52.0,
      "z_value": -9.709000000000161,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "GitNode \u2014 Mood Indicator",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "",
      "uuid": "62461784c104487ab27812dc7f4e2325",
      "x": 8281.404836771297,
      "y": 3122.0133748386233,
      "width": 300.0,
      "height": 200.0,
      "z_value": -9.71000000000016,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "`PaletteNodeData` has a hardcoded default of `\ud83d\ude0d`. Since the dataclass default is non-empty, the shuffle-on-load guard skips it. The palette always opens with heart eyes, but clicking More Glory shuffles it like any other node."
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "PaletteNode \u2014 Always Starts With Heart E",
      "uuid": "6089c2f6ae1d48778e29e8b9a311df3b",
      "x": 7944.326298327876,
      "y": 2919.717390631331,
      "width": 467.0,
      "height": 52.0,
      "z_value": -9.71100000000016,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "PaletteNode \u2014 Always Starts With Heart Eyes",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "Node-Specific Behavior",
      "uuid": "1151cb5168da4ba4896d761dc1368102",
      "x": 7536.652162140472,
      "y": 3183.649409394866,
      "width": 247.0,
      "height": 52.0,
      "z_value": -9.71200000000016,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "Node-Specific Behavior",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "",
      "uuid": "e1a960189fc745d8821b5a3b8db004b5",
      "x": 7203.489954394296,
      "y": 3004.014647564398,
      "width": 300.0,
      "height": 296.0,
      "z_value": -9.713000000000159,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "- **Session load**: Every node starts with an empty emoji. BaseNode's `_build_buttons` detects this and picks a random one from the pool before the button renders.\n- **Click**: Left-click shuffles to a new random emoji from the pool. The parent node repaints immediately.\n- **Session save**: Emoji is NOT persisted. The `to_dict` chain omits the emoji field entirely. Every session load is a fresh shuffle.\n- **Node removal**: `EmojiButton.detach()` nulls the get/set callback references to break parent capture cycles before GC."
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "Lifecycle",
      "uuid": "e1a7d3deb05146128dc3af17309551df",
      "x": 6859.427453425054,
      "y": 2748.5242586357854,
      "width": 118.0,
      "height": 52.0,
      "z_value": -9.714000000000159,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "Lifecycle",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "",
      "uuid": "d7165a431155432b822a6237994a0ae1",
      "x": 7130.0895846815,
      "y": 2713.365693043752,
      "width": 300.0,
      "height": 216.0,
      "z_value": -9.715000000000158,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "Each node has an EmojiButton in the top-left button strip. It renders a single emoji glyph from the shared pool, shuffles to a random one on click, and shuffles fresh on every session load. The graph never looks the same twice.\n\nThe emoji pool lives in `utils/IconPicker.py` \u2014 28 emoji in total, curated for warmth and personality."
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "Core Mechanism",
      "uuid": "594bbfd6b8864f9fa6f1788b3de0fac8",
      "x": 6926.512948879135,
      "y": 2845.8334973313395,
      "width": 168.0,
      "height": 52.0,
      "z_value": -9.716000000000157,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "Core Mechanism",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "",
      "uuid": "131a2668d13e4df88bd72b0f0ae2b29e",
      "x": 6679.545461420446,
      "y": 2928.508320040435,
      "width": 300.0,
      "height": 200.0,
      "z_value": -9.717000000000157,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "The EmojiButton system that gives every node a shufflable emoji accent. Named for its tooltip \u2014 click it and more glory arrives."
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "The More Glory Button",
      "uuid": "830584ebd5ac47c491df9f6a385f23e2",
      "x": 6220.161302799323,
      "y": 3456.647562741102,
      "width": 238.0,
      "height": 52.0,
      "z_value": -9.718000000000156,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "The More Glory Button",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "",
      "uuid": "28c88191d6fd42fc8040794b47d45c59",
      "x": 12047.1516565461,
      "y": 6106.200941675326,
      "width": 300.0,
      "height": 344.0,
      "z_value": -9.719000000000156,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "1. Launch `python main.py`\n2. Click Info \u2192 Nodes \u2192 any doc (e.g. \"The Stuff and Stuff Node\")\n3. MarkdownNode spawns, auto-fits to full content height\n4. Click the chain spawn button on the node\n5. Verify: AboutNodes appear for each heading, WarmNodes for each body section\n6. Verify: **all spawned nodes are chained** with Connection wires (heading\u2192body\u2192heading\u2192body)\n7. Verify: nodes don't overlap (spiral placement working)\n8. Verify: WarmNodes auto-size to fit their text content\n9. Close app during/after split \u2014 no crash"
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "Verification",
      "uuid": "7694bf95531440fd83a336c18b25ccaf",
      "x": 11268.806257848304,
      "y": 6568.438071219932,
      "width": 147.0,
      "height": 52.0,
      "z_value": -9.720000000000155,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "Verification",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "",
      "uuid": "42ff9b31a36a4aa6b4b0fc4c7b4766c7",
      "x": 10990.280989608038,
      "y": 6705.419278337879,
      "width": 300.0,
      "height": 280.0,
      "z_value": -9.721000000000155,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "- **Spiral algorithm** \u2014 ClaudeNode `_spawn_single_response()` lines 562-630 (the gold standard)\n- **Connection wiring** \u2014 `Connection(prev_node, node)` + `scene.addItem(conn)`\n- **WarmNode construction** \u2014 `WarmNode(WarmNodeData(body_text=..., title=\"\"))` then `_auto_fit_height()`\n- **AboutNode creation** \u2014 `scene.add_about_node(pos, label)` from Scene.py\n- **Button pattern** \u2014 `NodeButton(self, icon, callback)` appended to `self._buttons`"
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "Existing Code to Reuse",
      "uuid": "302406caa68e453fa0ab69ebe4b96152",
      "x": 10407.869177226432,
      "y": 7009.375779256687,
      "width": 248.0,
      "height": 52.0,
      "z_value": -9.722000000000154,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "Existing Code to Reuse",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "",
      "uuid": "2470c9dab3704d0e9b068af55fc2fa0e",
      "x": 10400.378339843506,
      "y": 6676.818906036356,
      "width": 300.0,
      "height": 216.0,
      "z_value": -9.723000000000154,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "| File | Change |\n|------|--------|\n| `utils/placement.py` | **New file** \u2014 `spiral_place()` extracted from ClaudeNode's algorithm |\n| `nodes/MarkdownNode.py` | Add `_split_into_nodes()` + spawn button in `_build_buttons()` |"
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "Files to Modify",
      "uuid": "1137530032e0405ba0a8533d826cf43a",
      "x": 10582.545425450831,
      "y": 6516.744402408564,
      "width": 178.0,
      "height": 52.0,
      "z_value": -9.724000000000153,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "Files to Modify",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "",
      "uuid": "5ab06c5fcadd431696f4c9e9748d3ec9",
      "x": 10512.94115538265,
      "y": 6276.351456400556,
      "width": 300.0,
      "height": 200.0,
      "z_value": -9.725000000000152,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "- Use `iconSpawnNodesClean` (the purple chain icon, `icons/spawn_nodes_clean.png`)\n- Since it's on the base class, all MarkdownNode subclasses inherit it\n- ReadmeNode keeps its existing button for now (it spawns AboutNodes only, different intent)"
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "3. Wire the button in `MarkdownNode._bui",
