      "z_value": -9.742000000000143,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "Running log of node-type cleanup fixes applied to `_prepare_for_removal()` across the codebase. Intricate hot-edits its own dataflow graph at runtime, so closing the app while nodes are mid-teardown is a frequent real-world scenario \u2014 every node type must survive it gracefully.\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "Node Cleanup Compliance",
