      "z_value": -9.80200000000011,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "JoyStatsNode \u2014 No Emoji",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "",
      "uuid": "3727c02a2783483596c83d1610a97a5d",
      "x": 8081.77470934819,
      "y": -1244.613125499896,
      "width": 300.0,
      "height": 200.0,
      "z_value": -9.80300000000011,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "AboutNode hides the standard EmojiButton (`_show_emoji_btn = False`) and builds its own shuffle mechanism. The emoji lives in `_shuffle_emoji` on the instance, not in `data.emoji`. Double-clicking the top strip reshuffles it."
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "AboutNode \u2014 Custom Shuffle",
      "uuid": "8c6307d2244543729eb445a990d25c09",
      "x": 7725.77470934819,
      "y": -1284.613125499896,
      "width": 296.0,
      "height": 52.0,
      "z_value": -9.804000000000109,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "AboutNode \u2014 Custom Shuffle",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "",
      "uuid": "b37e9e92af154e90abd4b71d29195f73",
      "x": 7365.77470934819,
      "y": -1324.613125499896,
      "width": 300.0,
      "height": 200.0,
      "z_value": -9.805000000000108,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "- **Offline push attempt**: Sets emoji to `\ud83d\ude12` (unamused face) when the connectivity check fails. A passive-aggressive but accurate status indicator.\n- **Successful push**: Shuffles to a random emoji from the pool \u2014 celebration mode."
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "GitNode \u2014 Mood Indicator",
      "uuid": "1889482df94d4cb7a6e06251289aa9ff",
      "x": 7028.77470934819,
      "y": -1364.613125499896,
      "width": 277.0,
      "height": 52.0,
      "z_value": -9.806000000000108,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "GitNode \u2014 Mood Indicator",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "",
      "uuid": "b79080eb0c8f4ff28f39a82764c07dd9",
      "x": 6668.77470934819,
      "y": -1404.613125499896,
      "width": 300.0,
      "height": 200.0,
      "z_value": -9.807000000000107,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "`PaletteNodeData` has a hardcoded default of `\ud83d\ude0d`. Since the dataclass default is non-empty, the shuffle-on-load guard skips it. The palette always opens with heart eyes, but clicking More Glory shuffles it like any other node."
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "PaletteNode \u2014 Always Starts With Heart E",
      "uuid": "21bb426a4a2d4ce4a4de3d5b47c05a04",
      "x": 6141.77470934819,
      "y": -1444.613125499896,
      "width": 467.0,
      "height": 52.0,
      "z_value": -9.808000000000106,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "PaletteNode \u2014 Always Starts With Heart Eyes",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "Node-Specific Behavior",
      "uuid": "4bb4d9a58fa74952aaac8daf9c7733af",
      "x": 5834.77470934819,
      "y": -1484.613125499896,
      "width": 247.0,
      "height": 52.0,
      "z_value": -9.809000000000106,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "Node-Specific Behavior",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "",
      "uuid": "9028a826fd454c4e826bb2d91c0120a4",
      "x": 5474.77470934819,
      "y": -1524.613125499896,
      "width": 300.0,
      "height": 296.0,
      "z_value": -9.810000000000105,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "- **Session load**: Every node starts with an empty emoji. BaseNode's `_build_buttons` detects this and picks a random one from the pool before the button renders.\n- **Click**: Left-click shuffles to a new random emoji from the pool. The parent node repaints immediately.\n- **Session save**: Emoji is NOT persisted. The `to_dict` chain omits the emoji field entirely. Every session load is a fresh shuffle.\n- **Node removal**: `EmojiButton.detach()` nulls the get/set callback references to break parent capture cycles before GC."
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "Lifecycle",
      "uuid": "228830ec2561497bacfe19b151fb1baa",
      "x": 5341.655225601937,
      "y": -1588.3733988107033,
      "width": 118.0,
      "height": 52.0,
      "z_value": -9.811000000000105,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "Lifecycle",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "",
      "uuid": "d35c6d9ce6c04bed870f2321e956f472",
      "x": 4898.494269014112,
      "y": -1275.9293447003936,
      "width": 300.0,
      "height": 216.0,
      "z_value": -9.812000000000104,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "Each node has an EmojiButton in the top-left button strip. It renders a single emoji glyph from the shared pool, shuffles to a random one on click, and shuffles fresh on every session load. The graph never looks the same twice.\n\nThe emoji pool lives in `utils/IconPicker.py` \u2014 28 emoji in total, curated for warmth and personality."
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "Core Mechanism",
      "uuid": "efdc1bfe430643a0ab8569205ebcb1c3",
      "x": 4729.894952291129,
      "y": -1742.2942491109927,
      "width": 168.0,
      "height": 52.0,
      "z_value": -9.813000000000104,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "Core Mechanism",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "",
      "uuid": "1e14e3111e414f5d9697a312ea2e84aa",
      "x": 4350.094724532125,
      "y": -1593.5320778084674,
      "width": 300.0,
      "height": 200.0,
      "z_value": -9.814000000000103,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "The EmojiButton system that gives every node a shufflable emoji accent. Named for its tooltip \u2014 click it and more glory arrives."
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "The More Glory Button",
      "uuid": "c89dfc63a5cc48758dadc99642711847",
      "x": 4131.295635568149,
      "y": -1690.2927307176187,
      "width": 238.0,
      "height": 52.0,
      "z_value": -9.815000000000103,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "The More Glory Button",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "",
      "uuid": "2aaf23472fcd45ae911be83ff0ba0a80",
      "x": 13355.609310988038,
      "y": 1896.8339812210388,
      "width": 300.0,
      "height": 248.0,
      "z_value": -9.817000000000101,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "- The button is a `QGraphicsObject` child of the node, not part of the paint pipeline. It positions itself via `_position_buttons()` in the button strip.\n- `get_emoji` and `set_emoji` are lambda closures capturing `self.data.emoji`. The `detach()` method nulls these before removal to prevent GC reference cycles.\n- The shuffle uses `random.choice()` which gives uniform distribution across the 28-emoji pool. No weighting, no history \u2014 pure random, every click."
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "Technical Notes",
      "uuid": "bc1025ee458246a9b0ba545863c8acaa",
      "x": 13117.609310988038,
      "y": 1856.8339812210388,
      "width": 178.0,
      "height": 52.0,
      "z_value": -9.8180000000001,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "Technical Notes",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "",
      "uuid": "b14ea426ddf845b68844851ed6227df2",
      "x": 12757.609310988038,
      "y": 1816.8339812210388,
      "width": 300.0,
      "height": 216.0,
      "z_value": -9.8190000000001,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "- **Depth Toggle Button**: Uses EmojiButton to render `\ud83d\ude2f` (front layer) or `\ud83e\udee4` (back layer). Not a shuffle \u2014 functional toggle.\n- **Tint Button**: Always renders `\ud83d\ude0e`. Triggers the color picker for node tinting.\n- **HoverGlow**: Not used by EmojiButton. The emoji button relies on click handling and LOD gating only."
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "Related Systems",
      "uuid": "28faa87f11744920af528d6d6b18606c",
      "x": 12519.609310988038,
      "y": 1776.8339812210388,
      "width": 178.0,
      "height": 52.0,
      "z_value": -9.8200000000001,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "Related Systems",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "",
      "uuid": "8e19c2b422934c64a721e8258067784f",
      "x": 11561.609310988038,
      "y": 1685.8339812210388,
      "width": 300.0,
      "height": 232.0,
      "z_value": -9.823000000000098,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "EmojiButton renders the glyph via `QPainter.drawText` using `Theme.healthFontFamily` at 70% of the button size constant. An `EMOJI_OVERFLOW` padding of 4px prevents glyph clipping at the bottom.\n\nThe button respects LOD gating \u2014 below 0.25 zoom, it skips rendering entirely so distant nodes stay clean."
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "Rendering",
      "uuid": "cbdbb99cdc2b41388f3a872c28c48be7",
      "x": 11393.609310988038,
      "y": 1616.8339812210388,
      "width": 118.0,
      "height": 52.0,
      "z_value": -9.824000000000098,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "Rendering",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "",
      "uuid": "3c60a24ae4014d1d9f9d33b4f3e1e9c6",
      "x": 11033.609310988038,
      "y": 1576.8339812210388,
      "width": 300.0,
      "height": 200.0,
      "z_value": -9.825000000000097,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "Four EmojiButton instances for specific actions, none of which are the More Glory shuffle:\n- `\ud83d\udc8e` Stamp source file with vision metadata\n- `\ud83d\udd0d` Read PNG metadata\n- `\u25cb` Toggle border\n- `\ud83d\udd04` Convert to PNG"
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "ImageNode \u2014 Action Buttons",
      "uuid": "db24fb6bd3324b13857359258203cbef",
      "x": 10676.609310988038,
      "y": 1536.8339812210388,
      "width": 297.0,
      "height": 52.0,
      "z_value": -9.826000000000096,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "ImageNode \u2014 Action Buttons",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
