      "z_value": -9.849000000000084,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "A matching launcher in the sidebar's Claude category opens the Claude desktop app with the same maximize-on-launch pattern. Accessible from the Anthropic logo menu alongside the Claude Node and Token Counter."
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "Claude App Launcher",
      "uuid": "7dafd23f02464d8e9b65a6053ba1b960",
      "x": 1594.2399863756207,
      "y": 1259.3935747030778,
      "width": 218.0,
      "height": 52.0,
      "z_value": -9.850000000000083,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "Claude App Launcher",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "",
      "uuid": "974d529658994f64b097ceef2ed44f55",
      "x": 1182.9800448714493,
      "y": 2552.312363112794,
      "width": 300.0,
      "height": 312.0,
      "z_value": -9.851000000000083,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "The cat emoji button (custom 3D icon inspired by the GitHub octocat) launches or focuses GitHub Desktop:\n\n- If already running, maximizes and focuses the existing window.\n- If not running, launches via the `github-windows://` protocol handler, then polls every 500ms for the window to appear and maximizes it automatically.\n\nThis works around a Windows limitation where apps do not reliably restore their maximized state across launches."
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "GitHub Desktop Launcher",
      "uuid": "18a7dcc569944922950cf9d698a2f00d",
      "x": 1241.4492362830088,
      "y": 1172.0733023886883,
      "width": 258.0,
      "height": 52.0,
      "z_value": -9.852000000000082,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "GitHub Desktop Launcher",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "",
      "uuid": "5d131765324148eb83be8c5a7085fd6b",
      "x": 3066.4153002922285,
      "y": 1356.6731051384,
      "width": 300.0,
      "height": 424.0,
      "z_value": -9.853000000000081,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "When spawned fresh from the sidebar, the GitNode performs a loading ritual:\n\n1. A VideoNode appears to the right, wired to the GitNode, playing a looping animation of a dancing plushie bear with \"YOU GOT THIS!\" \u2014 the most encouraging progress indicator in existence.\n2. The GitNode body shows \"hang on, gimme a sec...\" while the background thread scans repos.\n3. The moment the scan completes, the VideoNode is dismissed \u2014 it bursts into a particle simulation, the wire dissolves, and the repo list slides into place.\n\nThe same ceremony plays during bulk push operations. The plushie dances while commits and pushes run on the worker thread, then bursts into particles when the operation completes.\n\nSession restores skip the animation entirely \u2014 the node loads quietly with its last known state."
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "The Loading Ceremony",
      "uuid": "7f4009c9bb5348f7908ad94d57f7cad6",
      "x": 1137.7344522141618,
      "y": 1339.5586606129477,
      "width": 228.0,
      "height": 52.0,
      "z_value": -9.854000000000081,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "The Loading Ceremony",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "",
      "uuid": "6715a81241f64d3a9e21dfa22a5abfbf",
      "x": 1584.1756981101594,
      "y": 2011.4217657445272,
      "width": 300.0,
      "height": 392.0,
      "z_value": -9.85500000000008,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "The push button (sticker-style arrow icon) collects session and unpushed repos in a single operation:\n\n1. **Connectivity check** \u2014 pings `github.com:443` before anything else. If offline, spawns an AboutNode wired to the GitNode with a gentle reminder to turn the internet on, and sets the More Glory emoji to an unamused face.\n2. **Commit dialog** \u2014 if there are session repos, a frameless themed dialog asks for a commit message. Unpushed repos skip this step since they already have commits.\n3. **Worker thread** \u2014 session repos get `git add -A`, `git commit`, `git push`. Unpushed repos get just `git push`. All on a background thread so the UI stays responsive.\n4. **On completion** \u2014 the More Glory emoji shuffles to a random one (celebration), and the repo list refreshes to reflect the new state."
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "Bulk Push",
      "uuid": "b44551cb4077445faf9eb1f7f1fbef32",
